  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Dense dark clouds always cover the land. Female-shaped trees grow everywhere into a forest; trunks curve and branches wrap like a girl’s body in enchanting postures. In the deepest part, the tallest female-shaped tree king stands one thousand feet high, ramrod straight, with enormous branches like hands covering the chest and palms lifting a green treehouse hung with red vermillion fruits and reddish-brown rattan.",
      "chapters": [
        528
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "res_female_shaped_tree"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Later the land is dim and gloomy under dark path and soul path dao marks, with a large dense forest of those female-shaped trees at the center.",
      "chapters": [
        953
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "In the deepest part of the forest stands the tallest female-shaped tree king, one thousand feet high, lifting a green treehouse with red vermillion fruits. Inside sit Hei Bai and Hei tribe supreme elder Hei Cheng, who asks whether Hei Bai just returned from Ni Yu Blessed Land. With a shift of his mind, Hei Cheng loosens the defense over Xiao Hun blessed land a little so a butterfly letter Gu can fly in.",
      "chapters": [
        528
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_hei_bai",
        "fac_hei_tribe",
        "char_hei_cheng",
        "loc_ni_yu_blessed_land"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Hei Bai tells Hei Cheng in Xiao Hun blessed land that Ma tribe has relations to Snowy Mountain’s demonic path Gu Immortals as expected. After further orders about resources for Hei Lou Lan, Hei Bai leaves Xiao Hun blessed land.",
      "chapters": [
        537
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "hei-bai-and-hei-cheng",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_ma_tribe",
        "loc_snowy_mountain",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Hei Lou Lan brings Fang Yuan and Fairy Li Shan to the blessed land left by Hei Cheng. The land is clearly dominated by dark path and soul path dao marks and is dim and gloomy, and the female-shaped trees are a special resource Hei Cheng raised and created. Xiao Hun land spirit is a jade-green vine attached to familial emotion left by Su Xian Er to Hei Lou Lan. Fairy Li Shan says the ownership condition was to stay together forever with Su Xian Er, so after Hei Lou Lan took out that familial emotion she became master of the blessed land. The land spirit teleports them elsewhere in an instant, which Fang Yuan reads as many space path dao marks, and Fang Yuan places Luo Po Valley there.",
      "chapters": [
        953
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "entry-and-ownership",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_hei_lou_lan",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_fairy_li_shan",
        "char_su_xian",
        "loc_luo_po_valley"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan says that although Hei Lou Lan and Fairy Li Shan have joined the gamble, they are currently in Xiao Hun blessed land using Luo Po Valley to cultivate their souls, and that the Gu formation cuts off links between inside and outside and restricts his communication methods.",
      "chapters": [
        968
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "soul-cultivation-inside",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_formation"
      ]
    }
  ],
